# Paths whose changes cannot affect a build, test or lint result.
#
# One anchored extended regular expression (grep -E) per line. Blank lines
# and lines starting with # are ignored; the rest are joined with |.
#
# Consumers, all of which load this file the same way:
#   .githooks/pre-commit             a commit that changes only these paths
#                                    skips the cargo gates and the refuse check
#   scripts/tests/docs-only-paths-test.sh
#                                    no Rust source under crates/ reads a path
#                                    on this list
#   the worktree setup script, which reads it from main
#
# Everything not matched here is gated: a deletion, a rename, a snapshot, a
# fixture or a UI file runs fmt, clippy and test like any Rust change.
^docs/
^process-docs/
^\.github/
^packaging/
^\.copr/
^[A-Za-z_]+\.md$
^LICENSE$
